{"articleNo":"1949","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1949&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년 멕시코 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.08.16","hit":"9015","attachments":[{"name":"붙임4-2012멕시코 지원자 DB양식1.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1949&attachNo=69637"},{"name":"붙임1-2012멕시코 정부초청장학생 선발요강1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1949&attachNo=69874"},{"name":"붙임2-지원서A(본원소정양식)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1949&attachNo=70442"},{"name":"붙임5-General Terms and Conditions1.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1949&attachNo=70452"},{"name":"붙임3-Form B11.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1949&attachNo=71196"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">2012 멕시코정부초청 장학생 선발요강</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">1. 과정 및 선발예정인원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 과정 : 석사 혹은 박사과정 또는 연구과정 (기간연장포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 석박사 통합과정, 예비과정, 원격교육과정은 지원 불가 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 최종선발인원 : 5명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">2. 분야</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 치열교정술, 성형수술, 마케팅, 회계학, 광고학, 경영학 등을 제외한 모든 분야</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"525\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">지원서양식, 자세한 자격요건 및 멕시코정부장학생을 수용하는 대학리스트는 &lt;붙임4&gt;, &lt;붙임5&gt;를 참조</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">하고, 대학별 학과/전공에 대한 구체적인 자료는 해당 학교의 웹사이트를 참조할 것</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">3. 장학금 지급내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업료 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 월생활비 (석사 7,178.40페소, 박사 8,973페소) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 14.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 장학생에게 지급하는 생활비는 멕시코 최저임금의 4~5배에 해당하며, 금액은 &nbsp;멕시코정부 사정에 의해 다소 변동될 수 있음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 14.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 의료보험 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 14.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ Mexican Social Security Institution(IMSS) 의료보험이며, 장학금 지급 시작 3개월 후부터 적용되며 질병은 보장되지 않음. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">4. 장학금 지급기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 석사과정 : 2년 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 박사과정 : 3년</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 의학과정 : 3년 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* 장학금 지급기간은 연장을 불허하며, 수료후 석박사과정으로 연계될 수 없음. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">5. 지원 자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 대한민국 국적자 &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 현재 멕시코거주 유학생 지원 불가 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 학사 또는 석사학위 소지자(2011.8월까지 취득 가능한 자 포함) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 취득 학위(학/석사과정) 전과정 백분율 G.P.A. 80% 이상자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 스페인어로 대학 수강이 가능한 자 (스페인어 전공이 아닌 경우 상급 어학자격증 제출 요망)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">6. 제출서류 : 붙임 1 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">7. 지원 마감일: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 9. 16(금) 16:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">8. 지원서 제출 방법 : 붙임 1 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">붙임 : 1. 2012멕시코 정부초청장학생 선발요강 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 지원서A(본원소정양식) 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 지원서 Form B1 &nbsp;1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 2012 멕시코 지원자 DB양식 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. General Terms and Conditions 1부. 끝.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
